      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i'm just a bit worried about my meals being too boring if i have to cut out all that stuff. i've been feeling a bit low energy lately so i really need the protein. if i stick to mostly fresh stuff like chicken, eggs, and maybe some soy sauce for flavor, is that basically fine? i'm not planning on eating huge amounts of the fermented stuff, just small amounts for flavor. is it really that dangerous if it's just a little bit?",
